Package: simple-yt-downloader
Version: 2.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: MD. Mahmudul Hasan
Homepage: https://github.com/MDHasan0078/simple-yt-downloader
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, yt-dlp, ffmpeg, policykit-1
Description: Lightweight GTK3 GUI for downloading YouTube videos, audio, and playlists.
 A clean, single-window GTK3 desktop app for downloading YouTube videos,
 audio, and playlists with pause/resume support. Built on yt-dlp and
 ffmpeg, with a dependency checker and in-app dependency fixes.
